{"agent_id":"pp3g-7brH-implement-the-145-local-patch-to-opencode-remove-aaca","agent_seq":12,"timestamp":"2026-08-03T20:29:00.318648287Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"7fea5a54-4818-403e-a458-b39204695bbf","comment_uuid":"0056cb0f-2610-46c8-8dcb-726c26e2fafb","author":"pp3g-7brH-implement-the-145-local-patch-to-opencode-remove-aaca","content":"## Result: wrapSSE content-type guard REMOVED in installed opencode 1.18.11 — chunkTimeout now covers ALL response bodies\n\n### (1) Files patched\n**Installed binary**: /home/claude-code/.nvm/versions/node/v22.22.3/lib/node_modules/opencode-ai/bin/opencode.exe (v1.18.11). Chain: ~/.local/bin/opencode (bash wrapper) -> ~/.nvm/.../bin/opencode (symlink) -> opencode.exe (compiled Bun standalone ELF, 179,214,464 bytes). Original backed up at /tmp/opencode-145-patch/opencode.exe.ORIGINAL. Patched via atomic mv (running processes keep their inode; future launches use the patched binary).\n\n**Two identical wrapSSE guards patched** (source is embedded as plaintext minified JS in the Bun binary — confirmed identical to sst/opencode @ v1.18.11 provider.ts):\n- guard1 @ offset 97992444 (fn dy, provider.ts bundle, called from resolveSDK fetch wrapper)\n- guard2 @ offset 99193204 (fn or, AISDK bundle)\n- BEFORE (74 bytes): if(!$.headers.get(\"content-type\")?.includes(\"text/event-stream\"))return $;\n- AFTER (74 bytes, SAME LENGTH — no size change): if(false)return $;/*XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX*/\n\n### (2) Exact diff\nBinary: same-length byte replacement at both offsets (above). Canonical source-level diff (for a fork rebuild), file packages/opencode/src/provider/provider.ts:\n```diff\n function wrapSSE(res: Response, ms: number, ctl: AbortController) {\n   if (typeof ms !== \"number\" || ms <= 0) return res\n   if (!res.body) return res\n-  if (!res.headers.get(\"content-type\")?.includes(\"text/event-stream\")) return res\n \n   const reader = res.body.getReader()\n```\nSaved at /tmp/opencode-145-patch/opencode-145-wrapSSE.patch. headerTimeout behavior untouched (separate py() function + !body + !chunkTimeout checks intact).\n\n### (3) Verification (reused #144 harness: fake server, application/json content-type, headers then hang; chunkTimeout=3000)\n| Test | Unpatched | Patched |\n|---|---|---|\n| application/json + hang | 2 POSTs then TOTAL SILENCE; chunkTimeout never fires; hangs until overall 15s timeout | retries with exponential backoff (POSTs 20:22:01/03/08/15/26, gaps ~5/7/11s) — aborts within chunkTimeout, process alive+retrying until outer 40s kill (EXIT=124) |\n| chunkTimeout=2000 sensitivity | — | retry gaps track config (~2.25/4/6s) — proves mechanism is chunkTimeout |\n| healthy application/json response | — | normal completion, EXIT 0, no retries |\n| healthy text/event-stream stream | — | \"Hello world\", EXIT 0, no retries |\nZero ERROR entries in all hang cases (silent retry, matching #144's SSE observation). The 15s 'operation timed out' seen in my baseline is the AbortSignal.timeout overall timeout firing AFTER chunkTimeout was already bypassed — #144's truncated log missed it; the patch makes chunkTimeout fire FIRST (3s) instead.\n\n### (4) Rebuild needed\nInstalled opencode is a COMPILED binary (Bun standalone). The in-place byte patch is already applied and live — NO rebuild needed for the fix. For a canonical fork rebuild (survives future 'opencode upgrade'): bun is NOT currently installed; steps: install bun -> clone sst/opencode @ v1.18.11 -> apply the one-line provider.ts patch -> bun install && bun run build -> replace opencode.exe. Full steps in /tmp/opencode-145-patch/VERIFICATION.md.\n\n#145 left OPEN. Upstream PRs #39516/#35743 remain the proper long-term fix; this is our local fork-style divergence until they land.","created_at":"2026-08-03T20:29:00.311134136Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:bg2OOHea3dOqrFubYLs+v/VEJ6It/axDMl8kdTC3FKw","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQx/V1AO8xnaM+K/jpMoIK0c0cpFIgBtCFBZKKw+CZ88AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA7CZDVyuCryFccxeyE/fQ3wY5a8FpzpCRTL/ALmkyBc/dWfN8+vkYbYUXCLCjZknHxAsqU27y9pX+A9m7U9LSCg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:bg2OOHea3dOqrFubYLs+v/VEJ6It/axDMl8kdTC3FKw","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgQx/V1AO8xnaM+K/jpMoIK0c0cpFIgBtCFBZKKw+CZ88AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKWQEGpSdEZx96gRaczRgyX2qdwx59hGAzFlCXCDq1J0IkJoiwUksnCkGViVmr0W7SoJJ0Zetr8dI2J/+phqigA="}
